{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSRange","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"range"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCoordinates:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"coords"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"count:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSUInteger","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"count"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"range","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of vertices to replace. The "},{"code":"location","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" being the first vertex, "},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The "},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of vertices to replace."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"coords","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this array is copied to the shape’s "},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"count","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of coordinates from the "},{"code":"coords","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" array to insert in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place of the coordinates in "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The sum of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s length and this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count must not exceed the number of items currently in the "},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property in order for any style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is greater than the "},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effectively be inserted into the shape. On the other hand, if "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the "},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will effectively be removed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSRangeException","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised. If you want to append new vertices to the shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the "},{"code":"-appendCoordinates:count:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSource","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSource"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShape","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNMultiPoint","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class is an abstract superclass used to define shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composed of multiple vertices."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/shape":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","fragments":[{"text":"shape","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"shape","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/shape","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The contents of the source. A shape can represent a GeoJSON geometry, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"feature, or a collection of features.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:":{"type":"topic","title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:","abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"}}}